# GENERATED by `gleam run -m generate` in drills/ - do not edit.
# Checks every Go refactoring drill:   python3 verify_all.py [STEM...]
# Stages .verify/<stem>__<side>/ from the sources and runs it with `go run .`.
# The after must pass every case. The before must pass every behaviour
# case and fail at least one style case.
